      <span style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">DESTINATION PROTOCOL</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Doorstep Delivery Handover, Inventory Verification &amp; Placement at Jabalpur</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At Jabalpur, the final delivery and uncrating process is designed to ensure accuracy, safety, and customer satisfaction. The protocol begins with a daylight‑based verification against the original inventory bilty to confirm that every item has arrived as ordered.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">The first step is a meticulous walk‑through of the delivery zone.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Each pallet, container, and box is cross‑checked against the bilty’s item list, quantity, and serial numbers.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Discrepancies are documented immediately on a mobile log and the supplier is notified for prompt resolution.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This real‑time validation eliminates the risk of missing or mis‑shipped goods and guarantees that the client’s expectations match the physical stock.</span></li></ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Once the inventory is verified, the focus shifts to testing electrical and mechanical components.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Qualified technicians use calibrated multimeters, continuity testers, and load simulators to confirm voltage, resistance, and operational integrity.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>For mechanical assemblies, torque wrenches and alignment gauges verify that all fasteners and bearings meet manufacturer specifications.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Any defective unit is isolated, logged, and replaced according to the warranty agreement.</span></li></ul>

<p>With the items cleared, clean furniture placement follows. A dedicated staging area is marked with clear floor markings to guide the placement of each piece. The team uses padded dollies and soft‑grip handles to avoid scratches, and each item is positioned according to the client’s floor plan.</p>
<p>Special attention is given to high‑value or fragile items, which are protected with custom foam inserts and secured with tension straps. This organized placement not only preserves the aesthetic of the space but also facilitates future maintenance.</p>

<p>Finally, the removal of packing debris is executed swiftly and efficiently. All cardboard, bubble wrap, and protective films are collected in designated recycling bins.</p>
<p>Heavy pallets are lifted with forklifts and moved to the loading dock for immediate off‑loading to the waste management crew. The site is left clean, with no leftover debris, ensuring a safe working environment and a professional finish to the delivery process.</p></div>
